        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions SD-ATL100012SBR, 12 Inch Decorative Acrylic Shower Door Pulls</b>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"100%\"  border=\"0\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td valign=\"center\"  width=\"300\" class=\"text\">\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 12 Inch Atlantic Acrylic Shower Door Pulls are sold as a set with all the hardware you'll need to install them back-to-back on a 1/4 inch to 1/2 inch glass shower door. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThese ornate shower door handles are made in the USA from acrylic with UV inhibitors to prevent yellowing and fading. Available in your choice of <b>Frosted</b> or <b>Clear Acrylic</b>. The brackets are available in a wide array of finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe ornate detailing on the mounting bracket makes it a great choice for traditionally styled homes. It adds just enough detail to really make this acrylic shower door handle pop. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" align=\"center\" width=\"280\" class=\"text\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-910-size.gif?v=1704354497\" width=\"260\" height=\"260\" border=\"0\" alt=\"door pull filigree detail\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-ATL01012-specifcations.gif?v=1704354737\" width=\"499\" height=\"211\" border=\"0\" alt=\"First Impressions ATL100012SBR Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the First Impressions SD-ATL100012SBR Decorative Acrylic Shower Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Clear or Frosted Acrylic</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 9-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1/4\" to 1/2\" thick glass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-ATL01012-specifcations.pdf?v=1704262240\"><b>First Impressions ATL100012SBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Decorative Acrylic Shower Door Pulls, Pair,",
                "description": "First Impressions SD-ATL100012SBR, Atlantic Acrylic Shower Door Pulls - The 12 Inch Atlantic Acrylic Shower Door Pulls are sold as a set with all the hardware you'll need to install them back-to-back on a 1/4 inch to 1/2 inch glass shower door. These ornate shower door handles are made in the USA from acrylic with UV inhibitors to prevent yellowing and fading. Available in your choice of Frosted or Clear Acrylic. The brackets are available in a wide array of finishes.\r\n",
